{
  "about": [
    "Test vectors for usage event IDs (billing-stack docs/metering-design.md, 'Idempotency and event IDs'). Implementations in any language must reproduce every value here.",
    "canonicalJson: 'value' serialized with no whitespace and object keys sorted by Unicode code point (= UTF-8 byte order). Strings escape only \", \\ and U+0000-U+001F (\\b \\f \\n \\r \\t, else \\u00xx lowercase); everything else is written raw as UTF-8. 'sha256' is SHA-256 of the canonical UTF-8 bytes, 'hash' its first 16 hex characters.",
    "times: an instant in IDs is RFC 3339 UTC with Z, milliseconds only when non-zero, then always 3 digits.",
    "ids: delta = <resource id>:<meter>:<project id or ''>:<hash(dimensions)>:<hash(tags)>:<time(windowStart)>; interval = <resource id>:<meter>:<time(windowStart)>; gauge = <resource id>:<meter>:<project id or ''>:<hash(dimensions)>:<hash(tags)>:<time(occurredAt)>. The resource id is the last slug of resourceName.",
    "corrections: <original id>:c<n>, n from 1."
  ],
